# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Jörg Behler et al. (2014). Representing potential energy surfaces by high-dimensional neural network potentials.
#   Journal of Physics Condensed Matter. doi:10.1088/0953-8984/26/18/183001
#
# Version read: publisher (sha256 d1b13bd77e2e9035...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 70 (Method/model). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
#
# Encoding scope: bibliographic facts only. The article is a topical
# review of neural network potentials (low-dimensional NNPs for molecules
# and molecule-surface systems, the high-dimensional method, symmetry
# functions, construction and applications); it presents no new fit.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
